>≈</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where each <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"579\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is calculated by considering the step between a particular <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"580\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-value and the previous one, i.e.,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"581\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relati